     3366       run openbr IN THIS-PROCEDURE ( input yes, input no, input '':U).
     3367       REPOSITION br-cash-desk  TO RECID v-rec NO-ERROR.
     3368       APPLY "entry" TO br-cash-desk.
     3369     END.
     3370   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF Rs-object IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3371     DO:
